# Docker build context — what never leaves the host.
#
# The images already copy an explicit path list rather than `COPY . .` (see
# apps/api/Dockerfile), so nothing here is load-bearing for *correctness*. It is load-bearing
# for reproducibility and for the two failure modes a context directory actually causes:
#
#   1. Size. `.venv`, `node_modules`, `apps/web/.next` and the corpora under `data/` are
#      hundreds of MB to gigabytes. The daemon tars the context and sends it before the first
#      RUN executes, so an unbounded context makes every build slow and every CI cache useless.
#   2. Staleness. A host `.venv` or a `.next` built by a different platform copied into an
#      image wins over the image's own `uv sync` / `bun install`, and the image then reports
#      a dependency set that no lockfile describes. Excluded, the build can only be what
#      `pyproject.toml` + `uv.lock` + `bun.lock` say it is.
#
# Secrets are excluded as a second line of defence: `.env` is already untracked and refused by
# tests/unit/test_publication_preflight.py, and no Dockerfile takes it as a build arg.

# --- secrets and local identity -------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
credentials/
secrets/

# --- python environments and caches ---------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
.import_linter_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# --- js environment and build output (apps/web has its own ignore for its own context) ------
node_modules/
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/.next/
apps/web/out/
apps/web/.turbo/
apps/web/.test-output/
apps/web/playwright-report/
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- generated artifacts and corpora: rebuilt or fetched, never baked -----------------------
out/
artifacts/
mlruns/
data/raw/
data/interim/
data/snapshots/
data/processed/

# --- editor, agent and OS state -------------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.github/
.hermes/
.claude/
.qoder/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
notebooks/
*.canvas.data.json

# --- not repository content -----------------------------------------------------------------
# The last-day runbook is untracked now, so it is absent from a clone already; listed here so
# it cannot ride into a build context from a working directory that still has it.
SUBMISSION-CHECKLIST.md
